\title{gammaN: Asymptotic Covariance Matrix Under Normality}
\author{Ivan Jacob Agaloos Pesigan}
\date{}

\begin{document}

\maketitle

\section*{Description}

Helpers
for the asymptotic covariance matrix of the sample covariance matrix
under the multivariate normal distribution,
and for the sample covariance matrix of the data.
Each function has an internal version without input checks
that other projects can copy.

\section*{Installation}

You can install the development version of \texttt{gammaN} from
\href{https://github.com/ijapesigan/gammaN}{GitHub} with:

%% begin.rcode
% #| eval = FALSE
% if (!requireNamespace(package = "pak", quietly = TRUE)) {
%   utils::install.packages(pkgs = "pak")
% }
% pak::pkg_install(pkg = "ijapesigan/gammaN")
%% end.rcode

\section*{More Information}

See
\href{https://ijapesigan.github.io/gammaN/index.html}{GitHub Pages}
for package documentation.

